					PRINTFORMW 「%STONE_UKETSUKENAME%... Yup! That's a good name, I love it!」
					PRINTFORMW 「Thank you so very much, %CALLNAME:MASTER%-san!」
					PRINTFORML 
					BREAK
				ELSE
					CONTINUE
				ENDIF
			ENDIF
		LOOP 1
	CASE 1
		PRINTFORMW 「Very well... We'll put this on hold, I suppose.」
